{"unit_id": "tag:01LA:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。以<MATH_0002>表示拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（modules）所成的范畴（category），其定义见模（Modules）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n我们在第<REF_0002>节已经看到，范畴（category）<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>是仿射的（affine）时有许多良好性质。由于拟凝聚性（quasi-coherent）在<MATH_0006>上是局部的（local），任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）所成的范畴（category）也继承了这些性质。我们在此逐项列出。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0008>-模（modules）层（sheaf）<MATH_0009>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），当且仅当<MATH_0010>在每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0011>上的限制（restriction）具有形式<MATH_0012>，其中所用的<MATH_0013>-模（module）为某个<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0015>-模（modules）层（sheaf）<MATH_0016>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），当且仅当<MATH_0017>在某个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）的每个成员上的限制（restriction）都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的任意直和（direct sum）都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。\n<STRUCT_0006> 拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的任意余极限（colimit）都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）之间的态射（morphism）的核（kernel）与余核（cokernel）都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。\n<STRUCT_0008> 给定一个<MATH_0018>-模（modules）的短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0019>，\n若三项中有两项是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），则第三项也如此。\n<STRUCT_0009> 给定概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>，一个拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0021>-模（module）的拉回（pullback）是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0022>-模（module）。见模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0010> 给定两个拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0023>-模（modules），它们的张量积（tensor product）是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），见模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0011> 给定拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0024>-模（module）<MATH_0025>，<MATH_0026>上的张量（tensor）、对称（symmetric）和外（exterior）代数（algebras）都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），见模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0005>。\n<STRUCT_0012> 给定两个拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0027>-模（modules）\n<MATH_0028>、<MATH_0029>，若<MATH_0030>具有有限表示（finite presentation），则内部同态（internal hom）\n<MATH_0031>\n是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），见模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0006>及上文第（<REF_0007>）项。\n<STRUCT_0013>\n另一方面，拟凝聚模（coherent module）的直像（pushforward）一般并非拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）。下面给出该性质成立的一种情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚性"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部的"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "cokernel", "target_term": "余核"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"sour