{"unit_id": "tag:01LC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n若<MATH_0002>是拟紧的（quasi-compact）且是拟分离的（quasi-separated），则<MATH_0003>将拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>-模（modules）变为拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0005>-模（modules）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所给的箭头"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "给定态射的第一项条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的", "context": "给定态射的第二项条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "输入的模满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "被变换的模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "所得的模满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "变换所产生的模"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LC:proof", "translation": "此问题在<MATH_0001>上是局部的（local），因而可设<MATH_0002>是仿射的（affine）。由于<MATH_0003>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），可以写成\n<MATH_0004>，其中每个<MATH_0005>都是开的（open）且仿射的（affine）。\n由于<MATH_0006>是拟分离的（quasi-separated），可以写成\n<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>为某个仿射开集（affine open），见引理<REF_0001>。\n记<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>为<MATH_0011>的限制（restrictions）。对任意开集（open）<MATH_0012>（取自<MATH_0013>）及任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0014>（定义在<MATH_0015>上），有\n<MATH_0016>\n换言之，有层（sheaves）的正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0017>\n其中<MATH_0018>表示<MATH_0019>在相应开集（open）上的限制（restriction）。\n若<MATH_0020>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0021>-模（module），则<MATH_0022>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0023>-模（module），且<MATH_0024>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0025>-模（module）。\n于是由引理<REF_0002>可知，正合列（exact sequence）的第二项与第三项都是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0026>-模（modules）。因此可得<MATH_0027>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0028>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {