{"unit_id": "tag:01LA:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n据此可以如下刻画概形（schemes）之间的（闭（closed））浸入（immersions）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "原文括注限定后面讨论的浸入"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "下文要刻画的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LD:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>诱导<MATH_0003>与<MATH_0004>的一个闭子集（closed subset）之间的同胚（homeomorphism），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>\n是满射的（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0006>是概形（schemes）之间的闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理开头给定的箭头"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "同胚的目标"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "第一个假设所指定的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "第二个假设所指定的性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "结论中闭浸入的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理断言的态射类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01LD:proof", "translation": "假设（1）与（2）成立。由（1）可知，态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是拟紧的（quasi-compact）（见拓扑学（Topology）一章的引理<REF_0001>）。\n条件（1）与（2）推出引理<REF_0002>的条件（1）与（2）。\n因此<MATH_0002>是单态射（monomorphism）。特别地，<MATH_0003>是分离的（separated），见引理<REF_0003>。\n因此上文的引理<REF_0004>适用，从而<MATH_0004>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0005>-模（module）。\n于是<MATH_0006>的核（kernel）是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），由引理<REF_0005>可知。\n由于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）局部由截面生成（locally generated by sections）（见模（Modules）一章的定义<REF_0006>），这就推出<MATH_0007>是闭浸入（closed immersion），见定义<REF_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由条件（1）推出具有拟紧性的箭头"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "由条件（1）推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "所引引理的章名"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "应用前一判据所得的性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "由单态射性质所得的结论"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "应用上文引理所得模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "应用上文引理所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "由给定映射所取的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "所取的核具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "用来应用局部生成条件的层"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成", "context": "由拟凝聚性推出并用于判定闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引定义的章名"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "证明的最终结论"}], "notes": []}
