{"unit_id": "tag:02V0:statement", "translation": "概形（schemes）之间的浸入（immersions）的复合（composition）是浸入（immersion），概形（schemes）之间的闭浸入（closed immersions）的复合（composition）是闭浸入（closed immersion），且概形（schemes）之间的开浸入（open immersions）的复合（composition）是开浸入（open immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一种复合所涉及的概形"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "第一种复合的输入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "第一种情形中的态射运算"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "第一种复合的结果"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二种复合所涉及的概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第二种复合的输入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "第二种情形中的态射运算"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第二种复合的结果"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第三种复合所涉及的概形"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第三种复合的输入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "第三种情形中的态射运算"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "第三种复合的结果"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02V0:proof", "translation": "对开浸入（open immersions）而言，这一点是明显的，因为开子空间（open subspace）的开子空间（open subspace）仍是开子空间（open subspace）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）之间的闭浸入（closed immersions）。\n我们将验证<MATH_0003>也是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n假设表明，<MATH_0004>与<MATH_0005>都是到闭子集（closed subsets）的同胚（homeomorphisms），因而<MATH_0006>也是到闭子集（closed subset）的同胚（homeomorphism）。\n此外，映射（map）<MATH_0007>是满射的（surjective），因为它可分解为满射的（surjective）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0008>与\n<MATH_0009>的复合（composition）（这两个映射是满射的（surjective），因为<MATH_0010>是正合的（exact），见模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0001>）。\n因此，由上文的引理<REF_0002>，<MATH_0011>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n最后考虑浸入（immersions）的情形。\n设<MATH_0012>与<MATH_0013>是概形（schemes）之间的浸入（immersions）。\n这意味着存在开子概形（open subschemes）\n<MATH_0014>与<MATH_0015>，使得\n<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>、<MATH_0018>及<MATH_0019>都是闭浸入（closed immersions）。\n由于<MATH_0020>上的拓扑（topology）由<MATH_0021>上的拓扑（topology）诱导，可以找到一个开集（open）<MATH_0022>，使得<MATH_0023>。于是可见，<MATH_0024>是闭浸入（closed immersions）的复合（composition），因而是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n这证明了<MATH_0025>是浸入（immersion），所求结论随之成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphisms", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合的"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersions", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "证明首先处理的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "开浸入情形中再次取开子空间的对象"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "在前一开子空间内取的子空间"}, {"source_term": "open subspace", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "说明所取子空间在原空间中的性质"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "闭浸入的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "closed immersions", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第二种情形中给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第二种情形中需要验证的类型"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "两个给定同胚的目标"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphisms", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "给定闭浸入诱导的两个映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "复合同胚的目标"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "复合在底层空间上的性质"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "需要验证满射性的映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "要为该映射推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_ter